{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This DLC adds the game Chroma Wheel to the collection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colored balls come from the left and right, and your task is to rotate the wheel to hit each ball with its matching color. Red ball? Spin to red section! It's all about timing and accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to Play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the color wheel to match its segment with the incoming ball's color.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collide with correct colors to score points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missed matches reduce your health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your difficulty: Easy, Medium, or Hard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use arrows or WASD to rotate the wheel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tab or mouse the left or right sides of the screen to rotate the wheel</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981870?t=1758310917","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981870?t=1758310917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981870/24ef7f30f4842b9746708fa67dd893f556679a75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758310917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981870/24ef7f30f4842b9746708fa67dd893f556679a75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758310917","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This DLC adds the game Chroma Wheel to the collection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colored balls come from the left and right, and your task is to rotate the wheel to hit each ball with its matching color. Red ball? Spin to red section! It's all about timing and accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to Play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the color wheel to match its segment with the incoming ball's color.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collide with correct colors to score points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missed matches reduce your health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your difficulty: Easy, Medium, or Hard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use arrows or WASD to rotate the wheel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tab or mouse the left or right sides of the screen to rotate the wheel</p>","developers":["NanningsGames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3942710","name":"Infinite Game Cartridge Collection"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981870/1c68a1276819d36e87af4891c9c4f58954703785/header.jpg?t=1758310917","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257189247,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189247/movie480.mp4?t=1758310915","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189247/movie_max.mp4?t=1758310915"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189247/faaa03f7b5a48263d5150f46e59fc9865d25eef6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758310915","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189247/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758310915","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189247/m